//! stdlib/math/mod.sio — Mathematical operations and types
//!
//! This module provides comprehensive mathematical structures and algorithms:
//!
//! Core & Elementary:
//!   - core.sio: Basic functions (sin, cos, sqrt, exp, log, etc.) via FFI
//!   - pure.sio: Pure Sounio implementations of elementary functions (zero FFI)
//!   - constants.sio: Extended mathematical constants (50+ constants to full f64 precision)
//!
//! Algebra:
//!   - octonion.sio: 8-dimensional hypercomplex numbers
//!   - sedenion.sio: 16-dimensional hypercomplex numbers
//!   - tensor.sio: Tensor algebra (Kronecker, Hadamard, CP-ALS, Tucker HOSVD)
//!
//! Number Theory & Combinatorics:
//!   - number_theory.sio: GCD/LCM, primality (Miller-Rabin), factorization (Pollard rho),
//!                        modular arithmetic, Euler totient, Fibonacci, CRT
//!   - combinatorics.sio: Binomial, Stirling, Bell, Catalan, partitions, Bernoulli numbers
//!   - continued_fraction.sio: CF representation, convergents, best rational approximation,
//!                              Lentz-Thompson-Barnett evaluation
//!
//! Numerical Methods:
//!   - fft.sio: Cooley-Tukey radix-2 FFT/IFFT, convolution, power spectrum
//!   - numdiff.sio: Numerical differentiation (Richardson, gradient, Jacobian, Hessian)
//!   - approx.sio: Chebyshev approximation, Padé approximants, Remez minimax
//!   - interpolation.sio: Barycentric Lagrange, Newton, Hermite, PCHIP, cubic splines,
//!                         Stoer-Bulirsch rational interpolation
//!
//! Advanced:
//!   - interval.sio: Interval arithmetic with rigorous bounds (IEEE 1788 inspired)
//!   - information.sio: Shannon/Rényi entropy, KL/JS divergence, mutual information,
//!                       Hellinger distance, differential entropy
//!
//! See also: stdlib/special/ for gamma, beta, erf, Bessel, Airy, elliptic,
//!           hypergeometric, zeta, and orthogonal polynomials.

// Note: Direct re-exports not used due to parser limitations.
// Import individual modules: use math::core, use math::pure, etc.
